 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Determinantal-weight multiset",
 "statement": "Let $V$ be a finite-dimensional Weil representation on the preceding\nnormal geometrically connected curve $X_0$. Its *determinantal-weight\nmultiset* is\n\n$$\n\\bigl\\{\\!\\bigl\\{\\hyperref[def-wf-determinantal-weight]{\\dw_\\iota(S)}:\nS\\text{ a simple summand of }V^{\\mathrm{ss}}\\bigr\\}\\!\\bigr\\},\n$$\n\nwith one entry for every occurrence of $S$. Its independence of the\nchosen composition series is [lem-mg-semisimplification-independent].",
